RATES
Calcite
-start
10 k = PARM(1)
20 ssa = PARM(2)
30 rate = k * ssa
40 moles = rate * TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    Cu 10e-3
    Ba 5e-3
    units mol/kgw

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1
        -parms 10 1.0
        -steps 1000 in 100 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -high_precision true
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -molalities CO2

END
